The '''Taylander shuttle''' was a model of civilian [[transport]] [[shuttle]] manufactured by [[Gallofree Yards, Inc.]] and found throughout [[the galaxy]]. It was used as a transport [[Starship|ship]] for undercover operations by the early rebellion and the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]].

==Description==
An innocuous civilian craft, the Taylander [[shuttle]] was utilized as a [[transport]] [[starship]] and cargo vessel.<ref name="Databank" />

==History==
[[File:Taylander_shuttle.jpg|thumb|left|250px|A Taylander shuttle over Garel]]
During the [[Clone Wars]], one of the shuttles were used to send the [[infiltrator demolition droid]]s to [[Coruscant]].<ref name="HOBS">{{TCW|Heroes on Both Sides}}</ref>

Taylander shuttles were used throughout [[the galaxy]], and were common and innocuous sights everywhere from [[Coruscant]]'s bustling cargo lanes to [[Tatooine]]'s docking bays.<ref name="Databank" />

Three Taylander shuttles were used by [[Phoenix Cell]] during the [[Battle of Garel]] between [[Phoenix Squadron]] and the [[Galactic Empire]] on [[Garel]].<ref name="Legacy" /> One Taylander shuttle called the ''[[Chandrila Mistress]]'' transported the fugitive [[senator]] [[Mon Mothma]] to a rendezvous to meet with the [[Spectres]]. They were ambushed by Imperial forces and the ''Chandrila Mistress'' was destroyed.<ref name="Secret Cargo" />

After the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] [[Hijacking of the Harbinger|captured]] the [[Imperial I-class Star Destroyer|''Imperial I''-class]] [[Star Destroyer]] [[Harbinger (Imperial I-class)|''Harbinger'']], [[Admiral]] [[Verette]] and a contingent of [[Rebel trooper]]s fled in a Taylander shuttle. They were pursued by [[Task Force 99|SCAR Squadron]], who shot down the shuttle over the [[Ghost Moon]].<ref name="Star Wars 21" /> After [[Skirmish on the Ghost Moon|capturing]] Verette, SCAR [[Squadron]] strapped him to the front of the shuttle and sent him to the Rebel rendezvous point as a gruesome distraction. [[Sana Starros]] then blew the shuttle up.<ref name="Star Wars 23">[[Star Wars (2015) 23|''Star Wars'' (2015) 23]]</ref>

Following the [[mission to Ktath'atn]], [[Luke Skywalker]] and [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] took a shuttle on a mission during which Skywalker flew it into a [[nebula]] to avoid Imperial forces, but the [[Unidentified pink nebula|nebula]] disabled the ship, causing it to [[Escape from an unidentified ocean planet|crash]] on a [[Unidentified ocean planet|planet]] for three weeks. They were able to repair it and return to the [[Rebel Alliance Navy|Alliance Fleet]] after destroying an [[All Terrain Armored Transport (Galactic Civil War)|AT-AT]] using traps they had constructed.<ref name="Star Wars 33">[[Star Wars (2015) 33|''Star Wars'' (2015) 33]]</ref>

Years later, a gutted Taylander shuttle could be found on [[Jakku]]'s [[Niima Outpost]].<ref name="Force Collector">''[[Force Collector]]''</ref>

